---
// Italian-only promo video section (rendered on the IT home page only).
---
<section id="video" class="sec promo">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid top">
      <div class="tcol">
        <span class="plate plate--accent">
          <span class="dot" style="width:6px;height:6px;box-shadow:none"></span>
          Video · 1:13
        </span>
        <h2 class="h2">Ventic in poco<br />più di un minuto.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="body lcol">Perché i provider LLM non bastano, come funziona Ventic e cosa ottieni con un'infrastruttura LLM privata.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="frame panel">
      <video
        class="player"
        controls
        playsinline
        preload="none"
        width="1920"
        height="1080"
        poster="/video/ventic-promo-it-poster.jpg"
        aria-label="Video di presentazione di Ventic"
      >
        <source src="/video/ventic-promo-it.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        Il tuo browser non supporta i video HTML5. <a href="/video/ventic-promo-it.mp4">Scarica il video</a>.
      </video>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .promo { background: var(--ink); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-dim); }
  .top { align-items: end; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .tcol { grid-column: span 7; }
  .lcol { grid-column: span 5; }
  .plate { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .frame { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0; }
  .player { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #000; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .tcol, .lcol { grid-column: span 6; }
  }
</style>
